      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear the profound pain and despair in your words, and I want you to know that your feelings of hopelessness are real and valid. The idea that ending is \"more beautiful\" or \"cleansing\" is a dangerous thought that can take over when we are in the depths of depression, but it is not a safe or logical conclusion to a life worth living. Please connect with a crisis counselor who can help you through this dark moment and help you see a different way forward.",
